<item><title>Zambia&apos;s new proportional MPs call for scrapping presidential term limits</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/zm/zambia-s-new-proportional-mps-call-for-scrapping-78777e/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/zm/zambia-s-new-proportional-mps-call-for-scrapping-78777e/</guid><category>Zambia</category><description>In their maiden parliamentary speeches, some of the newly seated legislators urged the removal of presidential term limits, a position Lusaka Times says raises doubts.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 07:20:52 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/zm.jpg" length="32768" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/zm.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
